  "story": {
    "title": "Traffic Sense",
    "paragraphs_en": [
      "\" Traffic Signal\" Yes , You Guessed it correct. This is Traffic Signal.",
      "As You Can See, It has Three Color Lights.... RED, YELLOW AND GREEN",
      "When You See RED.... It means You Need to \"STOP\".",
      "Wait! When You See YELLOW .... What does it Mean? It Means \" Caution\"!",
      "What About Green then? When You See Green.... It means You can \"Go\".",
      "﻿ So, Now On Follow these Traffic Rules To Be Safe..... Happy Journey.....! Take care"
    ],
    "sentences": [
      {
        "text_en": "\" Traffic Signal\" Yes , You Guessed it correct.",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_135386/s_000.mp3",
        "text_vi": "\"Đèn Giao Thông\" Đúng rồi, con đoán đúng rồi đó."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "This is Traffic Signal.",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_135386/s_001.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Đây chính là Đèn Giao Thông."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "As You Can See, It has Three Color Lights....",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_135386/s_002.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Như con thấy đó, nó có ba màu đèn..."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "RED, YELLOW AND GREEN",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_135386/s_003.mp3",
        "text_vi": "ĐỎ, VÀNG và XANH LÁ."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "When You See RED....",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_135386/s_004.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Khi con thấy đèn ĐỎ..."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "It means You Need to \"STOP\".",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_135386/s_005.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Nó có nghĩa là con cần phải \"DỪNG LẠI\"."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Wait! When You See YELLOW ....",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_135386/s_006.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Đợi đã! Khi con thấy đèn VÀNG..."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "What does it Mean?",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_135386/s_007.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Nó có nghĩa là gì nhỉ?"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "It Means \" Caution\"!",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_135386/s_008.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Nó có nghĩa là \"Cẩn Thận\"!"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "What About Green then?",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_135386/s_009.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Vậy còn đèn XANH thì sao?"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "When You See Green....",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_135386/s_010.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Khi con thấy đèn XANH..."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "It means You can \"Go\".",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_135386/s_011.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Nó có nghĩa là con có thể \"ĐI\"."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "﻿ So, Now On Follow these Traffic Rules To Be Safe.....",
        "paragraph_index": 5,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_135386/s_012.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Vậy nên, từ bây giờ hãy tuân thủ các luật giao thông này để được an toàn nhé..."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Happy Journey.....! Take care",
        "paragraph_index": 5,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_135386/s_013.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Chúc con một chuyến đi vui vẻ...! Bảo trọng nha."
      }
    ]
  },
